  "faqQ1Title": "1. Device cannot connect or be detected",
  "faqQ1Body": "Make sure USB debugging is enabled and authorize USB debugging when connecting. This is required for Uotan WearBox to communicate with your device.",
  "faqQ2Title": "2. How to enable USB debugging",
  "faqQ2Intro": "Follow these steps:",
  "faqQ2Step1": "• Open <b>Settings</b> and tap <b>About</b>.",
  "faqQ2Step2": "• Tap <b>Build number</b> several times until developer mode is enabled.",
  "faqQ2Step3": "• Go back to <b>Settings</b> and open <b>Developer options</b>.",
  "faqQ2Step4": "• Enable <b>USB debugging</b>.",
  "faqQ3Title": "3. Why does my device show ADB debugging",
  "faqQ3Body": "ADB debugging and USB debugging are essentially the same. ADB communicates with the device over USB, so there is no difference.",
  "faqQ4Title": "4. How to connect wirelessly",
  "faqQ4Intro": "To enable wireless debugging, ensure the following:",
  "faqQ4Bullet1": "• Your computer and watch are on the same local network (2.4G or 5G is fine; they must be on the same IP subnet).",
  "faqQ4Bullet2": "• In Developer options on the watch, enable <b>Wireless debugging</b> or <b>WLAN debugging</b>.",
  "faqQ4Conclusion": "After enabling wireless debugging, you can operate the watch wirelessly with Uotan WearBox.",
  "faqQ5Title": "5. How to get the wireless debugging IP and port",
  "faqQ5Intro": "You can obtain them as follows:",
  "faqQ5Body": "Open Developer options on the watch and tap Wireless debugging information to view the current IP address and port.",
  "faqQ6Title": "6. Some features don't respond",
  "faqQ6Body1": "Some features may be unavailable due to OEM system limitations, especially on customized Android systems. Uotan WearBox supports about 90% of features on customized Android, e.g., OPPO Watch, Meizu Watch.",
  "faqQ6Body2": "WearOS by Google devices support about 99% of features, e.g., Pixel Watch, Mi Watch, TicWatch. You can try the operation multiple times.",
  "faqQ6Body3": "If a feature doesn't work, try again or reconnect the device.",
